{'symbol': 'T', 'date': '2022-05-16 07:46:00', 'title': 'AT&T INC. COMMENCES TENDER OFFERS FOR 63 SERIES OF NOTES', 'text': 'DALLAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AT&T INC. (NYSE: T) (“AT&T”) ANNOUNCED TODAY OFFERS TO PURCHASE FOR CASH (I) ANY AND ALL OF THE 54 SERIES OF OUTSTANDING NOTES DESCRIBED BELOW UNDER “HIGHER COUPON OFFERS”, UP TO A MAXIMUM $5 BILLION AGGREGATE AMOUNT OF HIGHER COUPON TOTAL CONSIDERATION (AS DEFINED BELOW) AND (II) ANY AND ALL OF THE 9 SERIES OF OUTSTANDING NOTES DESCRIBED BELOW UNDER “DISCOUNT OFFERS”, UP TO A MAXIMUM $3 BILLION AGGREGATE AMOUNT OF DISCOUNT TOTAL CONSIDERATION (AS DEFINED BELOW)'}